## 16A. Evidence File Lock (NO INLINE PASTES)
All required evidence MUST be written to a single `.md` or `.txt` file under:
`docs/reports/plans/`

The Windsurf chat response MUST NOT paste command outputs inline.
The evidence file MUST contain, in order:
